  "accesoSinRegistro": "The dealership gives you your access when you pick up your vehicle. If you don't have it, get in touch with them.",
  "accesoSubtitulo": "Your access to the dealership",
  "asistenciaGuiaChoquePaso1": "Stop the car in a safe place, turn off the engine and switch on the hazard lights.",
  "asistenciaGuiaChoquePaso2": "Check for injured people. If there are any, call 911 right away and do not move anyone with neck or back pain.",
  "asistenciaGuiaChoquePaso3": "If you can, get out and stand behind a barrier, away from traffic. Set out the warning triangles.",
  "asistenciaGuiaChoquePaso4": "Call your insurer and wait for the adjuster. Do not accept or sign agreements with the other driver without them.",
  "asistenciaGuiaChoquePaso5": "Take photos of the vehicles, plates, damage and the place. Write down the other driver's name, phone and insurance details.",
  "asistenciaGuiaChoquePaso6": "Do not move the car until the authorities or the adjuster allow it, unless it blocks the road and it is safe to move.",
  "asistenciaGuiaChoqueResumen": "Steps to look after everyone and protect your claim.",
  "asistenciaGuiaChoqueTitulo": "What to do after a crash",
  "asistenciaGuiaCorrientePaso1": "Park the other car facing yours, without touching. Turn off both engines and all accessories.",
  "asistenciaGuiaCorrientePaso2": "Connect a red clamp to the positive (+) terminal of your dead battery and the other end to the positive terminal of the car giving the charge.",
  "asistenciaGuiaCorrientePaso3": "Connect a black clamp to the negative (−) terminal of the good battery and the other end to an unpainted metal part of your engine, away from the battery.",
  "asistenciaGuiaCorrientePaso4": "Start the car giving the charge and let it run for a few minutes.",
  "asistenciaGuiaCorrientePaso5": "Try to start your car. If it does not start, wait a few more minutes and try again.",
  "asistenciaGuiaCorrientePaso6": "Remove the clamps in reverse order, without letting them touch, and keep your car running for at least 20 minutes.",
  "asistenciaGuiaCorrienteResumen": "How to start your car with cables from another vehicle.",
  "asistenciaGuiaCorrienteTitulo": "Jump-start the battery",
  "asistenciaGuiaLlantaPaso1": "Park on flat, firm ground, set the parking brake and switch on the hazard lights.",
  "asistenciaGuiaLlantaPaso2": "Take out the spare tire, the jack and the lug wrench. Slightly loosen the nuts of the flat tire without removing them.",
  "asistenciaGuiaLlantaPaso3": "Place the jack at the point shown in the manual and lift the car until the tire is off the ground.",
  "asistenciaGuiaLlantaPaso4": "Remove the nuts and the flat tire. Mount the spare and tighten the nuts by hand.",
  "asistenciaGuiaLlantaPaso5": "Lower the car, tighten the nuts in a star pattern with the wrench and check the pressure as soon as you can.",
  "asistenciaGuiaLlantaResumen": "Swap it for the spare in a few steps.",
